translation.incidentIo.webhookStep1	In incident.io go to Settings → Webhooks and create an endpoint with this URL
translation.incidentIo.webhookStep2	Under "Subscribe to events", select the four v2 incident events — incident_created_v2, incident_status_updated_v2, incident_updated_v2, and follow_up_created_v2 under public_incident (add the private_incident versions to deliver private incidents) — or leave the filter empty to send everything; Devin ignores event types it doesn't use
translation.incidentIo.webhookStep3	Paste the endpoint's signing secret below
translation.incidentIo.webhookSubtitle	Deliver incident events from incident.io to Devin
